  "Liking": {"Explanation": "The email uses personalization (addressing the receiver by their email address) and familiarity (referencing the sender's late husband and their son) to build trust and rapport with the receiver."},
  "Social proof": {"Explanation": "The email references the involvement of other people (the sender's son, Mr. Minja John Hinga) to build trust and credibility in the request."}
}

